dps-fleet folds in two pieces of third-party work, each still under its own
license — see the Credits section of README.md and docs/licenses/vehiclegear.txt:

- Luxart Vehicle Control (LVC), by Lt.Caine and TrevorBarns — GPL-3.
  dps-fleet copies no LVC code; a small, credited hook lives inside LVC's own
  files so it can read the per-vehicle siren-tone list dps-fleet assigns.
- Vehiclegear, by Lapertaja — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (full text in
  docs/licenses/vehiclegear.txt). dps-fleet's trunk-gear feature is
  DaemonAlex's fork of Vehiclegear folded into this resource.
